{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026rxgXqK6Ecf1795772649.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>不少人平時喜歡用臘味來炒四角豆，而肥媽則選用冰箱常備的鹹肉，炮製這道惹味家常菜「鹹肉炒四角豆」。這道菜式先靠蔥、薑、蒜爆香，再透過水分將鹹肉本身的鹹味與鮮味煮出來並滲入四角豆中，烹調時完全無須落鹽，成品香氣撲鼻，口感依然保持爽口美味。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"89276c23-5990-402d-856b-0910567c8980.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026J3cH0IdATZ1795772649.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>鹹肉炒四角豆｜食材</strong></p><p><strong>主要食材：</strong></p><ul><li><p>四角豆</p></li><li><p>鹹肉</p></li><li><p>紅蘿蔔</p></li><li><p>唐芹</p></li></ul><p><strong>爆香及調味配料：</strong></p><ul><li><p>蔥、薑、蒜</p></li><li><p>紹酒、麻油、糖、水（少許）</p></li></ul><p><strong>鹹肉炒四角豆｜做法</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>鹹肉先汆水：</strong> 將整塊鹹肉汆水，然後再切片並燙一下，以免成菜過鹹。</p></li><li><p><strong>爆香辛香料：</strong> 燒熱鍋子，放入蔥、薑、蒜爆香，帶出香氣。</p></li><li><p><strong>拌炒及加蓋燜煮：</strong> 接著放入已汆水的鹹肉，再放入四角豆及紅蘿蔔一同拌炒。期間只需加入紹酒、麻油及少許糖提味，放入切好的唐芹並加入少許水，然後蓋上</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"396255bb-8dbc-4723-bc75-0597df1bb56c.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026a4XT48ODbW1795772648.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:00.416067+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T13:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.086864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:18.716003+00:00","content_hash":"3ce5bb3468711bc4002d3c5019757bd623eaa533ffc9b60f77991ba4a3d61aca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:00.416067+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}